# dependencies
node_modules

# secrets: MONGO_URI, JWT_SECRET and the seed admin password live here
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Uploads
#
# The Knowledge Hub PDFs are 2.4GB and one of them is over GitHub's 100MB
# per-file limit, so they cannot live here. They belong on a persistent disk
# or in object storage — see DEPLOYMENT.md.
#
# Their cover thumbnails (9.8MB) and the imported site images (18MB) ARE
# committed on purpose: without them a fresh deploy renders the Knowledge Hub
# as several hundred broken images, and every post loses its picture. 28MB is
# a fair price for a site that looks right the moment it boots.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
uploads/documents/
uploads/*
!uploads/.gitkeep
!uploads/thumbnails/
!uploads/imported/

# logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
